WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.225
That’s the end of the course.

2
00:00:02.475 --> 00:00:04.425
A few final tips.

3
00:00:04.675 --> 00:00:10.100
Read every question twice and note whether it asks for true, magnetic or compass.

4
00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:16.000
Use the variation the question gives you, rather than the chart’s rose, when one is given.

5
00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:18.825
Show your work so you can find mistakes.

6
00:00:19.075 --> 00:00:26.650
If your answer is off by exactly one hundred eighty degrees, you read the wrong side of the rose or reversed a set.

7
00:00:26.900 --> 00:00:32.425
And use the plotting drills in this app every day until the calculations are automatic.

8
00:00:32.675 --> 00:00:35.825
You’ve now covered every module of the exam.

9
00:00:36.075 --> 00:00:37.950
Good luck, Captain.
